75592e9a-a81f-4b30-beb4-f0d05e04e565	pubmed:41832721	pubmed	Decoding the Blood-Brain Barrier: Innovative and Scalable Open-Source Machine Learning Model for Drug Permeability.	{"Anastasiia M Isakova","Dmitrii O Shkil","Ilya S Steshin","Ekaterina V Skorb","Maxim V Fedorov","Sergey Shityakov"}	The permeability of the blood-brain barrier (BBB) is an important property for potential drugs. Various in vitro and in vivo methods have been established to measure bloodbrain transport. Nevertheless, empirical assessment of the blood-brain barrier (BBB) for all drug candidates is both resource-intensive and costly.	2026-03-13	\N	0	Current neuropharmacology	[-0.012168205343186855, -0.028029583394527435, -0.0015428945189341903, 0.017159434035420418, -0.006010195706039667, 0.004313048906624317, -0.003954607993364334, 0.07377098500728607, -0.027180906385183334, 0.01466743927448988, 0.023449527099728584, -0.01740955002605915, -0.0028282555285841227, -0.024959711357951164, -0.027875997126102448, -0.026065677404403687, 0.020102916285395622, -0.010569363832473755, 0.013662250712513924, 0.0014566256431862712, 0.014597564935684204, 0.021288041025400162, 0.03076271153986454, -0.052419744431972504, 0.030725406482815742, 0.025644855573773384, 0.027232173830270767, 0.008154992014169693, -0.01785639300942421, -0.05056781694293022, 0.01456995215266943, -0.008627278730273247, -0.0014330302365124226, -0.05277466028928757, -0.0009745911811478436, -0.027877680957317352, -0.007660313975065947, -0.0007066219695843756, -0.02026301994919777, 0.06606961786746979, -0.019854314625263214, 0.01708950288593769, 0.012793966569006443, -0.006416553631424904, 0.028021620586514473, -0.009662635624408722, 0.03276529535651207, 0.03636680170893669, -0.02972421795129776, -0.031596701592206955, 0.008362952619791031, 0.022698117420077324, -0.007100023329257965, -0.0062111252918839455, 0.013891707174479961, 0.017175227403640747, -0.03586702421307564, -0.005875181406736374, -0.004289513919502497, 0.02276846207678318, -