9b440ea3-ae94-4678-9b28-9bb2a36ae228	pubmed:41833529	pubmed	Unsupervised deep learning-based 4DCT deformable image registration and carbon-ion 4D dose calculation.	{"Xiaoyan An","Jian Wang","Jun Zhang","Yinuo Liu","Maidina Abuduxiku","Ningning Chai","Ying Luo","Wei Wu","Yang Hu","Daqian Hei","Qiang Li","Pengbo He"}	Accurate four-dimensional dose calculation (4DDC) is essential for carbon-ion lung radiotherapy and relies on deformable image registration (DIR). However, conventional DIR methods are computationally intensive, hindering the implementation of online adaptive workflows.	2026-03-01	\N	0	Medical physics	[0.01062123104929924, -0.02086138352751732, 0.01585870422422886, -0.005957969930022955, 0.005312738940119743, -0.005091345869004726, 0.014356978237628937, 0.05724062770605087, -0.04529239982366562, -0.04110393300652504, 0.04136614128947258, -0.01340283453464508, -0.031504131853580475, -0.02991042472422123, -0.018342332914471626, -0.007769043557345867, 0.02485240250825882, 0.03630885109305382, 0.03178542107343674, -0.011026979424059391, -0.00021710668806917965, 0.03229834884405136, 0.009171879850327969, -0.022159311920404434, 0.03101339004933834, -0.012430641800165176, 0.03278058394789696, -0.0016389844240620732, -0.024662727490067482, -0.07423322647809982, 0.015363428741693497, -0.020525773987174034, 0.00804624892771244, -0.03865891695022583, 0.004319949075579643, -0.01872643642127514, 0.0013356015551835299, -0.013848491944372654, -0.028376974165439606, 0.019421475008130074, -0.021651770919561386, 0.021733099594712257, 0.020594874396920204, 0.0009159993496723473, 0.02667570486664772, -0.025911103934049606, 0.021843036636710167, 0.01442900113761425, -0.018271099776029587, -0.030981527641415596, -0.0009118279558606446, 0.02592310681939125, -0.015069350600242615, 0.025251666083931923, 0.027968434616923332, 0.03360801935195923, -0.030630221590399742, -0.00015949478256516159, -0.011831097304821014, 0.004537484608590603, -0.01245882734656334, 0.041194599121809006,