448d15ed-e85a-4ca4-ae0c-2dcad62ba294	pubmed:41887398	pubmed	Large-scale plasma proteomics for predicting future cardiovascular and all-cause mortality among individuals with cardiovascular-kidney-metabolic syndrome stage 0-3.	{"Bingtao Weng","Jiahe Wei","Han Chen","Yuyan Zhao","Ningjian Wang","Hongliang Feng","Sizhi Ai","Xiao Tan"}	Identifying high-risk individuals for cardiovascular and all-cause mortality among individuals with cardiovascular-kidney-metabolic (CKM) syndrome stage 0-3 can guide the implementation of targeted interventions. This study aimed to evaluate the predictive value of plasma proteins for future cardiovascular and all-cause mortality.	2026-03-24	\N	0	Metabolism: clinical and experimental	[-0.012489127926528454, -0.00906639639288187, -0.02374490164220333, 0.01836824044585228, -0.008498871698975563, 0.01880127750337124, -0.007857528515160084, 0.06499002128839493, -0.0069051338359713554, -0.030377961695194244, 0.014912809245288372, 0.0003340502444189042, -0.01798577420413494, -0.024146229028701782, 0.006318467669188976, 0.00937030278146267, 0.0014652477111667395, 0.006870838347822428, 0.010442893952131271, -0.011484472081065178, 0.004113103728741407, 0.021282482892274857, 0.026451675221323967, -0.029084715992212296, 0.01515626348555088, 0.008520319126546383, 0.030627859756350517, -0.008115890435874462, -0.027202794328331947, -0.0634513646364212, 0.022440768778324127, -0.02406010776758194, 0.006853571627289057, -0.08490727841854095, 0.01947859115898609, -0.007341448683291674, 0.014132674783468246, 0.006251668557524681, -0.0040572695434093475, 0.04242653772234917, -0.02646857127547264, 0.019147412851452827, 0.0058584436774253845, 0.012898464687168598, -0.01435079239308834, 0.02287445403635502, 0.02573995664715767, -0.016033584251999855, -0.019907306879758835, -0.016630472615361214, -0.002136420691385865, 0.018319107592105865, -0.023885829374194145, 0.041233379393815994, 0.053334902971982956, 0.026975387707352638, -0.03773880749940872, -0.039355196